  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening animal health systems for biological threat reduction in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is to contribute to reducing the risks and impact of biological threats through strengthened national animal health systems in Southeast Asia, through improved epidemiological capability, strengthened laboratory networks, and enhanced strategic surveillance and early warning systems across animal health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
